# Names only — values live in Vercel → Project → Settings → Environment Variables (D-26: no secret in this repo).
# The bestelbon (api/order.js). Without RESEND_API_KEY `npm run dev` dry-runs: the mails and the WhatsApp text are
# printed in the dev-server terminal, nothing is sent.
RESEND_API_KEY=
ORDER_MAIL_FROM=
ORDER_MAIL_TO=
TWILIO_ACCOUNT_SID=
TWILIO_AUTH_TOKEN=
TWILIO_WHATSAPP_FROM=
ORDER_WHATSAPP_TO=
TWILIO_CONTENT_SID=
ORDER_DRY_RUN=
# The metrics spine (row 13b: api/hit.js, api/wa.js → src/lib/metrics.js): the DGA metrics project's URL and the
# insert-only `ingest` key. Without them nothing is sent; `npm run dev` prints the row instead.
METRICS_URL=
METRICS_KEY=
# The assistant (rows 11b + 11c): the weekly mail of unanswered questions (api/qa-digest.js, Vercel cron) and the call
# log + daily cap of the Claude layer (api/ask.js) — the site token whose sha256 sits in the metrics database.
QA_DIGEST_TOKEN=
CRON_SECRET=
# The assistant's Claude layer (row 11c, api/ask.js): the owners' Anthropic key (their own Console workspace) and the
# model. Without the key the function answers „fallback” and the box answers with its local engine, as after row 11b.
ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=
ANTHROPIC_MODEL=
# The order store and the shop's screen (row 12: api/order.js, api/admin.js, api/bestelling.js). BLOB_READ_WRITE_TOKEN
# comes from connecting the private Blob store to the project (Vercel → Storage); ADMIN_PASS_HASH and ADMIN_SECRET from
# `node scripts/admin-pass.mjs` on Dan's machine (the passphrase is typed there, never written anywhere). Without the
# token, with ORDER_DRY_RUN=1 or on a preview deployment the bestelbon works as before (random reference, nothing stored).
# Outside Vercel the store stays off unless ORDER_STORE_LOCAL=1.
BLOB_READ_WRITE_TOKEN=
ADMIN_PASS_HASH=
ADMIN_SECRET=
ORDER_STORE_LOCAL=
